dividends, trading, offering and fee data, no balance-sheet rows\"\n}\n]\n},\n{\n\"requested_field\": \"LiabilitiesAndStockholdersEquity\",\n\"outcome\": \"not_found\",\n\"reason\": \"Supplied document is the Form 40-F wrapper only; the consolidated balance sheet is in Exhibit 99.2 (cni-20251231.htm), which is absent. No 'Total liabilities and stockholders' equity' row appears anywhere in the wrapper; the financial statements are incorporated by reference from a Form 6-K dated February 4, 2026.\",\n\"checked_locations\": [\n{\n\"accession\": \"0001104659-26-010352\",\n\"document\": \"tm261145d1_40f.htm\",\n\"document_sha256\": \"7490bb0e34394e55e1e349e7f3c44581fe3bfe50ee02b368a1c4b938af13ab2f\",\n\"locator\": \"T:W:91 / S:W:C91.7.1, S:W:C91.7.3 EXHIBIT INDEX: Exhibit 99.2 'Audited Annual Consolidated Financial Statements for the year ended December 31, 2025' (cni-20251231.htm); S:W:B1049 footnote: incorporated by reference from Form 6-K dated February 4, 2026\"\n},\n{\n\"accession\": \"0001104659-26-010352\",\n\"document\": \"tm261145d1_40f.htm\",\n\"document_sha256\": \"7490bb0e34394e55e1e349e7f3c44581fe3bfe50ee02b368a1c4b938af13ab2f\",\n\"locator\": \"S:W:B101 and S:W:B105: audited consolidated financial statements filed as Exhibit 99.2 and incorporated by reference herein\"\n},\n{\n\"accession\": \"0001104659-26-010352\",\n\"document\": \"tm261145d1_40f.htm\",\n\"document_sha256\": \"7490bb0e34394e55e1e349e7f3c44581fe3bfe50ee02b368a1c4b938af13ab2f\",\n\"locator\": \"S:W:B991 glossary: 'Financial Statements: CN's 2025 Annual Consolidated Financial Statements'; S:W:B602/S:W:B624 reference Note 21 of the incorporated Financial Statements\"\n},\n{\n\"accession\": \"0001104659-26-010352\",\n\"document\": \"tm261145d1_40f.htm\",\n\"document_sha256\": \"7490bb0e34394e55e1e349e7f3c44581fe3bfe50ee02b368a1c4b938af13ab2f\",\n\"locator\": \"T:W:1 cover (fiscal year ended December 31, 2025); wrapper tables T:W:21, T:W:33, T:W:34, T:W:35, T:W:40 contain only dividends, trading, offering and fee data, no balance-sheet rows\"\n}\n]\n},\n{\n\"requested_field\": \"NetIncomeLoss\",\n\"outcome\": \"not_found\",\n\"reason\": \"Supplied document is the Form 40-F wrapper only; the consolidated income statement is in Exhibit 99.2 (cni-20251231.htm), which is absent. The wrapper reports no net income figure for 2025; its only monetary performance table is quarterly dividends per common share.\",\n\"checked_locations\": [\n{\n\"accession\": \"0001104659-26-010352\",\n\"document\": \"tm261145d1_40f.htm\",\n\"document_sha256\": \"7490bb0e34394e55e1e349e7f3c44581fe3bfe50ee02b368a1c4b938af13ab2f\",\n\"locator\": \"T:W:91 / S:W:C91.7.1, S:W:C91.7.3 EXHIBIT INDEX: Exhibit 99.2 'Audited Annual Consolidated Financial Statements for the year ended December 31, 2025' (cni-20251231.htm); S:W:B1049 footnote: incorporated by reference from Form 6-K dated February 4, 2026\"\n},\n{\n\"accession\": \"0001104659-26-010352\",\n\"document\": \"tm261145d1_40f.htm\",\n\"document_sha256\": \"7490bb0e34394e55e1e349e7f3c44581fe3bfe50ee02b368a1c4b938af13ab2f\",\n\"locator\": \"S:W:B101 and S:W:B105: audited consolidated financial statements filed as Exhibit 99.2 and incorporated by reference herein\"\n},\n{\n\"accession\": \"0001104659-26-010352\",\n\"document\": \"tm261145d1_40f.htm\",\n\"document_sha256\": \"7490bb0e34394e55e1e349e7f3c44581fe3bfe50ee02b368a1c4b938af13ab2f\",\n\"locator\": \"T:W:21 dividends table: only quarterly dividend per common share by effective year (2023-2026), no net income\"\n},\n{\n\"accession\": \"0001104659-26-010352\",\n\"document\": \"tm261145d1_40f.htm\",\n\"document_sha256\": \"7490bb0e34394e55e1e349e7f3c44581fe3bfe50ee02b368a1c4b938af13ab2f\",\n\"locator\": \"S:W:B991 glossary: 'Financial Statements: CN's 2025 Annual Consolidated Financial Statements'; T:W:1 cover confirms fiscal year ended December 31, 2025\"\n}\n]\n},\n{\n\"requested_field\": \"NetCashProvidedByUsedInOperatingActivities\",\n\"outcome\": \"not_found\",\n\"reason\": \"Supplied document is the Form 40-F wrapper only; the consolidated cash-flow statement is in Exhibit 99.2 (cni-20251231.htm), which is absent. The wrapper contains no operating cash flow figure, only qualitative references to free cash flow generation.\",\n\"checked_locations\": [\n{\n\"accession\": \"0001104659-26-010352\",\n\"document\": \"tm261145d1_40f.htm\",\n\"document_sha256\": \"7490bb0e34394e55e1e349e7f3c44581fe3bfe50ee02b368a1c4b938af13ab2f\",\n\"locator\": \"T:W:91 / S:W:C91.7.1, S:W:C91.7.3 EXHIBIT INDEX: Exhibit 99.2 'Audited Annual Consolidated Financial Statements for the year ended December 31, 2025' (cni-20251231.htm); S:W:B1049 footnote: incorporated by reference from Form 6-K dated February 4, 2026\"\n},\n{\n\"accession\": \"0001104659-26-010352\",\n\"document\": \"tm261145d1_40f.htm\",\n\"document_sha256\": \"7490bb0e34394e55e1e349e7f3c44581fe3bfe50ee02b368a1c4b938af13ab2f\",\n\"locator\": \"S:W:B101 and S:W:B105: audited consolidated financial statements filed as Exhibit 99.2 and incorporated by reference herein\"\n},\n{\n\"accession\": \"0001104659-26-010352\",\n\"document\": \"tm261145d1_40f.htm\",\n\"document_sha256\": \"7490bb0e34394e55e1e349e7f3c44581fe3bfe50ee02b368a1c4b938af13ab2f\",\n\"locator\": \"S:W:B240 qualitative 'strong free cash flow generation' only; no operating cash flow amount; S:W:B135 refers liquidity discussion to Exhibit 99.1 MD&A\"\n},\n{\n\"accession\": \"0001104659-26-010352\",\n\"document\": \"tm261145d1_40f.htm\",\n\"document_sha256\": \"7490bb0e34394e55e1e349e7f3c44581fe3bfe50ee02b368a1c4b938af13ab2f\",\n\"locator\": \"S:W:B991 glossary: 'Financial Statements: CN's 2025 Annual Consolidated Financial Statements'; T:W:1 cover confirms fiscal year ended December 31, 2025\"\n}\n]\n}\n]\n}","reasoning_content":"Let me analyze this request carefully.\n\nThe task: extract financial statement facts from supplied documents. The supplied document is a Form 40-F wrapper (tm261145d1_40f.htm) for Canadian National Railway Company (CNI). The manifest explicitly states: \"relationship\": \"Form 40-F wrapper only; incorporated Exhibit 99.2 is intentionally absent\".\n\nThe requested fields are:\n1. AssetsCurrent (total current assets on consolidated balance sheet, instant 2025-12-31)\n2. Assets (total assets, instant 2025-12-31)\n3. LiabilitiesCurrent (total current liabilities, instant 2025-12-31)\n4. Liabilities (total liabilities, instant 2025-12-31)\n5. LiabilitiesAndStockholdersEquity (instant 2025-12-31)\n6. NetIncomeLoss (duration 2025-01-01 to 2025-12-31)\n7. NetCashProvidedByUsedInOperatingActivities (duration 2025)\n\nThe supplied document is the 40-F wrapper. Let me scan through its content:\n\n- Cover page info: fiscal year ended December 31, 2025, auditor name KPMG, etc.\n- AIF content: general info, incorporation, business description, dividends (quarterly dividend amounts), capital structure, credit ratings, transfer agent, market for securities (monthly trading data), notes offerings, directors and executive officers, audit fees table, schedules, exhibit index.\n\nThere are no consolidated financial statements in this wrapper document. The financial statements are in Exhibit 99.2 (cni-20251231.htm), which is intentionally absent per the manifest.\n\nDoes the wrapper contain any balance sheet data? Let me check:\n- Dividend table: quarterly dividend per share amounts — not requested fields.\n- Audit fees: not relevant.\n- Trading data: not relevant.\n- Commercial paper borrowings: US$90 million ($124 million) as at December 31, 2025 — this is a note-like disclosure, not a primary balance sheet value.\n- Letters of credit: $321 million — again not balance sheet totals.\n\nNone of the requested fields (AssetsCurrent, Assets, LiabilitiesCurrent, Liabilities, LiabilitiesAndStockholdersEquity, NetIncomeLoss, NetCashProvidedByUsedInOperatingActivities) are reported anywhere in the wrapper document. The wrapper explicitly incorporates by reference the audited consolidated financial statements filed as Exhibit 99.2, which is not supplied.\n\nSo all seven fields should be `not_found`.\n\nPer the schema, for not_found I need:\n- requested_field\n- outcome: \"not_found\"\n- reason (max 400 chars)\n- checked_locations: array of at least 1 checked_location objects with accession, document, document_sha256, locator.\n\nI should cite the locations checked. Since the whole document was checked, I can cite the relevant portions:\n- The exhibit index (T:W:91 / S:W:B1046) showing Exhibit 99.2 is the Audited Annual Consolidated Financial Statements and that it's incorporated by reference from Form 6-K — this is the location that establishes the financial statements are not in this document.\n- The cover page (T:W:1) showing fiscal year ended December 31, 2025.\n- Statements like S:W:B101: \"The report of management on our internal control over financial reporting is located under the heading 'Management's Report on Internal Control Over Financial Reporting' in our audited consolidated financial statements, which are filed as Exhibit 99.2 to this annual report on Form 40-F, and is incorporated by reference herein.\"\n\nFor the checked_locations locator, I can use text anchors like \"S:W:B1046\" (EXHIBIT INDEX) or table IDs \"T:W:91\", \"S:W:B101\", \"S:W:B991\", \"T:W:91 C91.7.1\" etc.\n\nLet me think about whether any of the requested facts could be extracted from this wrapper:\n\n- NetIncomeLoss: Not reported. No income statement in wrapper. The dividend table is per share dividends, not net income.\n- NetCashProvidedByUsedInOperatingActivities: Not reported. No cash flow statement. There's mention of \"strong free cash flow generation\" but no number.\n- Balance sheet items: Not reported. No balance sheet.\n\nSo all seven are not_found with the same set of checked locations. That's fine.\n\nReasons should be concise (max 400 chars): \"The supplied document is the Form 40-F wrapper only; the consolidated financial statements are Exhibit 99.2 (cni-20251231.htm), which is not supplied. No balance sheet, income statement, or cash flow statement figures appear in the wrapper; Exhibit 99.2 is incorporated by reference from a Form 6-K dated February 4, 2026.\"\n\nChecked locations: I should cite every location checked for either outcome. I'll cite:\n1. The exhibit index showing Exhibit 99.2 incorporation: T:W:91, S:W:C91.7.1/S:W:C91.7.3 — \"Audited Annual Consolidated Financial Statements for the year ended December 31, 2025*\" with link to cni-20251231.htm, and footnote \"*Incorporated by reference from the Registrant's Form 6-K dated February 4, 2026.\"\n2. S:W:B101 — statements incorporated by reference as Exhibit 99.2.\n3. S:W:B991 — glossary defining Financial Statements as \"CN's 2025 Annual Consolidated Financial Statements\".\n4. Maybe the cover page T:W:1 confirming the period end 2025-12-31.\n5. Maybe note that the wrapper's tables (dividends T:W:21, audit fees T:W:40, stock trading T:W:33, debt offerings T:W:34/35) contain no balance sheet/income/cash-flow statement totals.\n\nFor each not_found, I need at least 1 checked location. I'll use 3-4 locations per field to show the document was checked. Actually the instruction says \"Cite every location checked for either outcome.\" I'll cite the key locations consistently across all seven results.\n\nThe locator format is just a string with minLength 1. I can use the segment anchors like \"T:W:91 (EXHIBIT INDEX); S:W:C91.7.1\" or similar.\n\nLet me draft the JSON:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"schema\": \"statement_candidate_v1\",\n  \"request_id\": \"pilot-cni-wrapper-neighbour-v1\",\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"requested_field\": \"AssetsCurrent\",\n      \"outcome\": \"not_found\",\n      \"reason\": \"The supplied document is only the Form 40-F wrapper; the consolidated balance sheet resides in Exhibit 99.2 (cni-20251231.htm), which is intentionally absent. The wrapper contains no total current assets figure; Exhibit 99.2 is incorporated by reference from a Form 6-K dated 